---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Landscaper Templates"
  description="Three landscaping website templates I built as a sales tool. A business owner picks the layout they like and I customize it for them."
  client="My own project, for landscaping businesses"
  role="Design and development"
  year="2026"
  liveUrl="https://landscapertemplates.netlify.app"
  liveLabel="See the templates"
  slides={[
    {
      title: 'Template 1',
      src: '/videos/web-development-project-landscaper-templates-1.mp4',
      poster: '/images/landscaper-templates-1.webp',
    },
    {
      title: 'Template 2',
      src: '/videos/web-development-project-landscaper-templates-2.mp4',
      poster: '/images/landscaper-templates-2.webp',
    },
    {
      title: 'Template 3',
      src: '/videos/web-development-project-landscaper-templates-3.mp4',
      poster: '/images/landscaper-templates-3.webp',
    },
  ]}
  highlights={[
    { value: '3 templates', label: 'Same sections, three different designs' },
    { value: 'One page', label: 'Visitors switch between templates without leaving the page' },
    { value: 'Free customization', label: 'Included when a business owner chooses a template' },
  ]}
  overview={[
    'Most landscaping business owners want to see what their website would look like before they commit to anything. Instead of showing mockups, I built three complete landscaping websites and put them on one page with a switcher that stays visible while you scroll.',
    'All three templates have the same sections: a headline that says what the company does and where, services, a project gallery, reasons to choose the company, customer reviews and a contact section with a quote request. The layout, fonts, photos and colors are different in each one so an owner can pick the one that fits their business.',
    'The templates are generic on purpose. The text and photos are placeholders. Once a business owner picks a template, I replace the placeholder content with their business name, photos and service area. That customization is free.',
    'The templates are hand-coded HTML, CSS and JavaScript hosted on Netlify. Each finished site loads quickly, costs nothing to host and has no plugins or page builder to maintain.',
  ]}
  tools={['HTML & CSS', 'JavaScript', 'Netlify', 'Figma', 'Photoshop']}
/>
